"Everything here works without it — capture, effects, recording, transcription, monitoring, and routing to any real output. What it adds is one thing: other applications can then choose YunAudio as their microphone, over a path that is bit-exact rather than resampled." = "沒有它,這裡的一切照常運作 —— 擷取、效果、錄音、轉錄、監聽,以及路由到任何真實輸出。它只多加一件事:別的應用程式可以把 YunAudio 選成自己的麥克風,而且走的是位元對位元、不經重取樣的路徑。";
"Everything is already balanced. Nothing to change." = "已經平衡了，不需要調整。";
"Everything this application produces reaches OBS later than the picture does, by however much the effect chain adds. OBS has a field for that and no way of working out what belongs in it; this does. The value is negative there, because it says to treat the sound as having happened earlier." = "音訊比畫面晚到 OBS，晚的量等於效果鏈增加的延遲。OBS 有對應欄位但算不出該填多少，這裡算得出來。填入負值，表示把聲音視為更早發生。";
